Subject: [PATCH] qthread_unix: include <sys/prctl.h> whenever prctl() is called

The include was guarded by Q_OS_LINUX && !QT_LINUXBASE while the call it
serves is guarded by Q_OS_LINUX alone, so any QT_LINUXBASE build fails with
"use of undeclared identifier 'PR_SET_NAME'".

--- a/src/corelib/thread/qthread_unix.cpp
+++ b/src/corelib/thread/qthread_unix.cpp
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@
 #include <sys/pstat.h>
 #endif
 
-#if defined(Q_OS_LINUX) && !defined(QT_LINUXBASE)
+#if defined(Q_OS_LINUX)
 #include <sys/prctl.h>
 #endif
 
